{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Micro Edit",
  "prompt": "glitch micro-edit bass: every 1/16 a hashed pattern switches between an FM growl, a folded saw and a crushed square (spliced on zero-crossings), adds pitch ramps and repeats slices, all with 0.3 ms edges, while the master pings the edits left and right; Glitch goes from steady to fully chopped",
